": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "4807", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAmRzn5wH5B9ePI_0psThdx8S003cWdvj8IzDKSly6m6w", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAmRzn5wH5B9ePI_0psThdx8S003cWdvj8IzDKSly6m6w", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "fangzhouzia7", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "老己的Vlog官号🅥", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_osWPhiNvi17MgCYIvAhNOn5AA4aBAHzRbEVDA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "22", "last_modify_ts": 1794420058740}, {"comment_id": "7604586407798227761", "create_time": 1770580757, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7604000753062463163", "content": "感谢江寻千（九月）博主[比心]，不远千里来到我们大西北陇西，学习非遗文化“高烨”。谢谢你用心传播我们的传统文化，也谢谢你包容这座小城的民风民俗。你的到来不仅带来了流量，让更多人看到了陇西的美。[玫瑰]\n       感谢江寻千（九月）把“年”提前带到了陇西！看着街头闹哄哄的秧歌，才发现年味早就藏在这锣鼓声里了。愿这份热闹能治愈我们一整年，2026，大家都要越来越好！[玫瑰][玫瑰][玫瑰]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "614", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAXBh6fYgLo8ABaZ-f85OC1eHEG6mZF6l-zq09IS6YVt2eB34gi1GSrDZMjkOSJMoD", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAXBh6fYgLo8ABaZ-f85OC1eHEG6mZF6l-zq09IS6YVt2eB34gi1GSrDZMjkOSJMoD", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "LaoHu.723", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "麻P烦", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_o8qQBh2oIAqECfqAEoAChEARA9FWjofRywcDFE.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "8", "last_modify_ts": 1794420058740}, {"comment_id": "7604575276668797733", "create_time": 1770578165, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7604000753062463163", "content": "真的很感激有人宣传，其他地方也是有社火的只不过可能种类风格不一样，还有他们熟练的样子都是在严寒中一遍遍苦练出来的，为的就是展现民俗风情和传统文化，让更多人了解社火。以前社火真的很热闹，但由于基本都是本地人在看，老一辈在表演传承，所以没有以前人多了，希望这一次他们的坚持可以被看见，让社火重回以前。最后甘肃欢迎您!", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "497", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAAiRqfU0PhrDdvlgzyC5_TMg81dmXq2ek-z-jjxgfoAjtpTXVhhA-7-_Gedsay4